# by SlangPermutations in components-tests: "[<define set>] glsl-only: <line>"; every listed line must occur, so a stale
# entry fails the test. All of them are declarations the GLSL keeps and never reads (glslang keeps unused declarations,
# Slang drops them); a pipeline layout may hold bindings and a vertex stage may write outputs a shader does not read,
# so nothing the pipeline builds changes.
#
